\n    border: 1px solid #2196F3;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    width: 28px;\n    height: 28px;\n    line-height: 26px;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .icon-person {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 40px;\n    height: 50px;\n    background: #e3f2fd;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 50px;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    color: #2196F3;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    margin-right: 5px;\n  }\n  .highlight-box {\n    border: 1px solid #2196F3;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    padding: 8px 12px;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    background: #f0f7ff;\n  }\n  .red-underline {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #c0392b;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;\n  }\n  .calc-line {\n    margin: 2px 0;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .equals {\n    margin-left: 20px;\n  }\n  .fraction-inline {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n    margin: 0 2px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    line-height: 1.2;\n  }\n  .fraction-inline .fnum {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n    padding: 0 3px 1px;\n  }\n  .fraction-inline .fden {\n    padding: 1px 3px 0;\n  }\n  .red-text {\n    color: #c0392b;\n  }\n  .blue-text {\n    color: #1a5276;\n  }\n  .boxed {\n    border: 1px solid #c0392b;\n    padding: 1px 4px;\n    display: inline-block;\n  }\n  .arrow-label {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n  }\n  .dialogue-row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin: 8px 0;\n  }\n  .dialogue-row .avatar {\n    width: 35px;\n    height: 45px;\n    background: #e3f2fd;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-size: 20px;\n  }\n  .dialogue-row .bubble {\n    border: 1px solid #999;\n    border-radius: 8px;\n    padding: 6px 10px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    background: #fafafa;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n  .dialogue-row.right {\n    flex-direction: row-reverse;\n  }\n  .dialogue-row.right .bubble {\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  .handwritten-large {\n    color: #c0392b;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin: 5px 0;\n  }\n  .calc-block {\n    margin: 5px 0 5px 20px;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 2.2;\n  }\n  .calc-block .line {\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n  .sub-calc {\n    margin-left: 30px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"header-top\">\n    <span class=\"logo\">📘 同步解析与测评</span>\n    <span class=\"subject\">数学 五年级 下册</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-title\">3.分数加减混合运算</div>\n<div class=\"lesson-title\">第 1 课时 分数加减混合运算</div>\n\n<div class=\"explore-header\">\n  <span class=\"explore\">探究</span>\n  <span class=\"circle\">交</span>\n  <span class=\"circle\">流</span>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"intro-text\">小华收集整理的全班同学在母亲节送给妈妈的礼物情况如下表。</p>\n\n<table class=\"gift-table\">\n  <tr>\n    <th>礼物类型</th>\n    <th>贺卡</th>\n    <th>鲜花</th>\n    <th>自己画的画</th>\n    <th>其他</th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>占全班人数的几分之几</td>\n    <td><span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">1</span><span class=\"fden\">4</span></span></td>\n    <td><span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">20</span></span></td>\n    <td><span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span></td>\n    <td></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<div class=\"content-columns\">\n  <div class=\"col-left\">\n    <div class=\"problem-title\">1.送贺卡和送鲜花的同学比送自己画的画的同学多占全班人数的几分之几？</div>\n\n    <div class=\"method-label\">方法一：</div>\n    <div class=\"calc-block\">\n      <div class=\"line\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">1</span><span class=\"fden\">4</span></span> + <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">5</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">20</span></span> + <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span> <span class=\"arrow-label\">——通分</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">8</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">8</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">6</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">20</span></span> <span class=\"arrow-label\">——再次通分</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">2</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">20</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">1</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">10</span></span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"method-label\">方法二：</div>\n    <div class=\"calc-block\">\n      <div class=\"line\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">1</span><span class=\"fden\">4</span></span> + <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">5</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">20</span></span> + <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">6</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">20</span></span> <span class=\"arrow-label\">——一次通分</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">2</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">20</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text boxed\">1</span><span class=\"fden red-text boxed\">10</span></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"col-right\">\n    <div style=\"text-align: right; margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n      <div class=\"speech-bubble\" style=\"display: inline-block; font-size: 12px;\">\n        这两种方法有什么不同？哪一种简便？\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"handwritten-large\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n      通分次数不同<br>\n      方法二简便\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"problem-title\">2.送其他礼物的同学占全班人数的几分之几？</div>\n\n    <div class=\"method-label\">方法一：</div>\n    <div class=\"calc-block\">\n      <div class=\"line\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1 − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">1</span><span class=\"fden\">4</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= 1 − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">5</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">3</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">6</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">20</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">5</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">3</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">6</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">6</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> = <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">3</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">10</span></span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"method-label\">方法二：</div>\n    <div class=\"calc-block\">\n      <div class=\"line\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1 − (<span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">1</span><span class=\"fden\">4</span></span> + <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">20</span></span> + <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum\">3</span><span class=\"fden\">10</span></span>)</div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= 1 − (<span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">5</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> + <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">3</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> + <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">6</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span>)</div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= 1 − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">14</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> = <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">20</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> − <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">14</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"line equals\">= <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">6</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">20</span></span> = <span class=\"fraction-inline\"><span class=\"fnum red-text\">3</span><span class=\"fden red-text\">10</span></span></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div style=\"text-align: right; margin: 5px 0;\">\n      <div class=\"speech-bubble\" style=\"display: inline-block; font-size: 12px;\">\n        这两个算式有什么不同呢？\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"problem-title\">3.通过前面的计算，你能说一说分数加减混合运算的运算顺序吗？</div>\n\n    <div class=\"dialogue-row\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\">👦</div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\">\n        分数加减混合运算的运算顺序和整数加减混合运算的运算顺序 <span class=\"red-text red-underline\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">相同</span>。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"dialogue-row right\">\n      <div class=\"avatar\">👧</div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\">\n        没有括号的，按照<span class=\"red-text red-underline\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">从左到右</span>的顺序计算；有括号的，先算<span class=\"red-text red-underline\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">括号里面</span>的，再算<span class=\"red-text red-underline\" style=\"font-weight: bold;\">括号外面</span>的。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"page-number\">\n  <span>70</span>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>",
        "reasoning_content": "The user wants me to convert an image of a Chinese math textbook page into HTML. Let me analyze the layout carefully.\n\nThe page is from a 5th grade math textbook (数学 五年级 下册), section 3 about fraction addition and subtraction mixed operations (分数加减混合运算), Lesson 1.\n\nThe layout has:\n- Header with title\n- A \"探究交流\" (Explore and Communicate) section\n- A table showing gift types and fractions\n- Two columns of content with problems 1, 2, 3\n- Handwritten notes in red\n\nLet me structure this carefully with the two-column layout.\n\nThe table shows:\n- 礼物类型: 贺卡, 鲜花, 自己画的画, 其他\n- 占全班人数的几分之几: 1/4, 3/20, 3/10\n\nProblem 1: 送贺卡和送鲜花的同学比送自己画的画的同学多占全班人数的几分之几？\n- 方法一: 1/4 + 3/20 - 3/10 with step-by-step calculation\n- 方法二: 1/4 + 3/20 - 3/10 with one-step common denominator\n\nProblem 2: 送其他礼物的同学占全班人数的几分之几？\n- 方法一: 1 - 1/4 - 3/20 - 3/10\n- 方法二: 1 - (1/4 + 3/20 + 3/10)\n\nProblem 3: 通过前面的计算，你能说一说分数加减混合运算的运算顺序吗？\n\nThere are handwritten notes in red ink.\n\nLet me create the HTML with proper layout."
